  "details": "Regarding the update you made with that banning system, I don't have a problem, it's just that what comes to my mind is that if I go on a public server and someone doesn't like my avatar and starts yelling at me for it, they could report me, and your system might interpret that as a violation of the rules at the top level, and in that case, you would give me a ban that I wouldn't deserve because I didn't do anything. For example, I might just join somewhere, and someone immediately yells at me because of my avatar, reports me, and your system would interpret that as a rule violation and I would get banned.",
